					"content": "阿祇似乎真的不見了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400511702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400511702,
					"content": "剛才一路走來，應該沒有看漏吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400511703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400511703,
					"content": "…又是這個情節。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400511704
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400511704,
					"content": "唔，好了好了別消沉了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400511705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400511705,
					"content": "往好裡想，海祇島的軍士大部分都撤走了。如果剛才真的有龍蜥來過這裡，至少沒人因此受傷。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400511706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400511706,
					"content": "雖然想到那個傢伙就生氣，但是我們只能試一試了。去把光路引導到這裡吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
