					"content": "仔細數了一下，似乎年幼的小龍蜥已經不見了。應該是被救走了吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400511902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400511902,
					"content": "這下面真的進來了深海龍蜥。那個傢伙說的是真的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400511903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400511903,
					"content": "阿祇她難道真的是龍蜥人嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400511904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400511904,
					"content": "不過到處都沒有看到她，她究竟在哪裡呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400511905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400511905,
					"content": "唉，不想這麼多了，我們返回上面吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
