					"content": "震驚，居然真的能解決問題！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400511102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400511102,
					"content": "這一次那個傢伙沒有騙我們呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400511103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 400511103,
					"content": "嚴格來說，他沒怎麼騙過我們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400511104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400511104,
					"content": "#按照他那套詭辯來說是這樣啦，{F#妳}{M#你}怎麼感覺有點和他互相理解了！這可不行啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400511105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
